/S /P
/E (We have recorded a good positive start for the quarter. Key completed projects such as ICGS Apoorva, a fast patrol vessel, AB Urja Shrota,  fuel barge and  Tug Mahabali, a tug vessel,  have contributed significantly to our revenue stream. Our ongoing projects include FB Pradayak and FSI Cradle. Additionally, MV Ubaidulla, MV Cheriyam, ICGS Anagh, and ICGS Amal are scheduled to begin repair work in the coming days, further strengthening our order book.)
