/S /P
/E (The company is currently in a take-off phase after major improvements in its plant & machinery during the last financial year. All unsecured loans from directors have been fully repaid. Owing to improved business performance and stronger collections during the last quarter \(December to March 2025\), the company has successfully met its working capital requirements without relying on any external funding sources, apart from existing banking facilities.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
